<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PRIMER MES · A1</view><view class="title">今天，先完成这一小步。</view><view class="subtitle">前四周 28 天小任务，先复习，再理解，最后开口与表达。中断后从薄弱处继续。</view>
<view class="card body"><view class="list-title">{{started ? '沿用一年计划的起点' : '先设一个学习起点'}}</view><view class="body">{{started ? '开始日：' + startDate + ' · 已经过 ' + elapsed + ' 天' : '开始后才能记录今天的小任务；所有内容仍可预览。'}}</view><view class="small body">已勾选三个任务 {{completedDays}} / 28 天。这是手工练习记录，不是打卡或掌握证明。</view><button hover-class="button-press" wx:if="{{!started}}" class="primary" bindtap="start">从今天开始计划</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="year">查看一年计划</button></view>
<view class="note">按实际进度调整，不强求赶日历。课程与分级包仍按前置学习开放；未来天可预览，不能提前勾选。手工任务不改变词量、课程得分或自动打卡。本页未提供音频与发音评分。</view>
<picker range="{{dayLabels}}" value="{{pickerValue}}" bindchange="select"><view class="pill">{{dayLabels[pickerValue]}} ▾</view></picker><button hover-class="button-press" class="ghost" bindtap="current">回到建议的今天</button>
<view class="card"><view class="pill">第 {{plan.week}} 周 · 第 {{selectedDay}} 天 · 约 {{plan.minutes}} 分钟</view><view class="section-title">{{plan.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="body"><view class="list-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="body">{{item.text}}</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{!canCheck}}" bindtap="check">{{item.checked ? '✓ 已记录' : '○ 做完后勾选'}} · {{item.label}}</button></view><button hover-class="button-press" class="primary" bindtap="target">打开本日配套内容 →</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="study">练今日词卡</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="drills">查看独立分级练习</button></view>
<view class="small">记录可反选；过去任务在实际勾选当天记录日期。建议新词不等于已经学会的词，缺少反馈时先保留需要改进的问题。</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="ghost" bindtap="home">回到今日</button></view>
